With this I've understood everything. Time to make a ToDo list and write the code.

## ToDo List
1. Implementation of treefiles.c (construct_path, mkdir_path, open_treefile, delete_treefile)
2. Integration into nbd-server.c: read/write paths (rawexp*), setupexport, expflush, parse_cfile validation
3. F_TREEFILES branch in exptrim (nbdsrv.c) — file deletion for trimmed blocks
