3. rawexpread / rawexpwrite / rawexpsplice — branch on F_TREEFILES at the top.

rawexpread treefiles:

```c
ssize_t rawexpread(off_t a, char *buf, size_t len, CLIENT *client) {
	if (client->server->flags & F_TREEFILES)
		return tree_read(a, buf, len, client);
